	(text "GPIO: 0 BOOT, 1/2/4-9 2x12 header, 10-13 SPI2 (GPIO matrix) to the XVF flash (10 MOSI=DI, 11 CLK, 12 MISO=DO, 13 CS), 14 PROG switch sense, 15/16 XVF LED_R/G taps, 17 XVF\nINT_N, 18 mux ST, 19/20 USB, 21 XVF reset (Q701), 38/39 I2C SDA/SCL, 40 user LED, 41 mute LED, 42 user button, 43/44 UART0 TX/RX (J701 21/22), 47 ring\nenable, 48 ring data.\nNot connected: strapping pins 3, 45, 46 and PSRAM pins 35-37 (N16R8 = octal PSRAM). Antenna: IPEX connector on the module, antenna off board."
